OL,3,GNEWSAThe portraits that helped bring
OL,4,Athe lost Aberfan children home
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor almost 60 years, many of Aberfan's
OL,7,Flost children have watched over living
OL,8,Frooms, hallways and family gatherings
OL,9,Facross the village.
OL,11,FSome were painted from faded school
OL,12,Fphotographs. Others were shaped by the
OL,13,Fmemories of grieving parents, who wrote
OL,14,Fletters to an artist describing the
OL,15,Fchildren they had lost: the colour of
OL,16,Ftheir eyes, their favourite clothes,
OL,17,Fthe flashes of personality that made
OL,18,Fthem unique.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
