OL,3,GNEWSAThe portraits that helped bring
OL,4,Athe lost Aberfan children home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe portraits arrived in the years
OL,7,Fafter one of Wales' darkest days. And
OL,8,Ffor many families, they became far more
OL,9,Fthan paintings.
OL,11,FIn a new BBC programme, Unseen: The
OL,12,FAberfan Portraits, some have shared
OL,13,Ftheir paintings and spoken about how
OL,14,Fthe art helped them grieve.
